<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Sample Every</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Polylines &gt; Sampling &gt; Sample Every</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Sample Every</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command samples the visible selected polylines at the given spacing. After this function the distance between two neighbour vertices is equal to the given value.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:left;" align="left"><img src="processing_polylines_files/sample_every.jpg" width="257px" height="165px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Sample every</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Sample spacing. Default value for this command is 1mm.</span></p>
<p class="Normal"><span lang="EN-GB">This command is grayed if there is no polyline selection or all selections are hidden. It affects the entire polyline, no matter if it is wholly or partially selected.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP162392341" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs5">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs6">
<td class="whs7">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="processing_polylines_files/image084.jpg" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs9">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="processing_polylines_files/image086.jpg" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs6">
<td class="whs10">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Polyline before applying Sample Every</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs11">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Polyline after applying Sample Every (2mm)</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
<p><span class="Command">Sample Every</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command allows you to reduce the number of points in the selected polylines while maintaining the accuracy. This may be done before exporting to reduce the file size.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Related topic:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="chordal_tolerancing.htm">Chordal Tolerancing</a></span></p>
